    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d438">

                <pb facs="0538" n="434" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg434"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/926.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Consul at Puerto Plata to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Puerto Plata</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-10-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 16, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>All misunderstanding cleared away. The revolutionists have accepted treaty of
                    peace signed in Santo Domingo October 6 [omission in transmission]. Vásquez and
                    Céspedes have signed the original copy and deposited it with me.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hathaway</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
